<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LA Stores shareholders approve acquisition.</title>
<headline>LA Stores shareholders approve acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clothing company LA Retail Stores Ltd said on Friday that shareholders had approved its acquisition of Skye Products (Pty) Ltd and the creation of 50 million &quot;N&quot; shares of 0.5 cents each to increase its share capital.</p>
<p>It said all conditions precedent to its acquisition of Skye had now been met and, as a result, the listing of some 24.57 million &quot;N&quot; shares issued in terms of the acquisition agreement had been listed on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange on June 12.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
